  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into wedges. Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the wedges between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625f91336a7d773f7a3577f4/step-a6352f9a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn. Finely chop celery.\n• Place your hand flat on top of haloumi and slice through the centre to get two thin pieces, then slice each piece in half.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels, tossing occasionally, until lightly charred, 4-5 minutes. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are \"popping\" out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625f91336a7d773f7a3577f4/step-e0f723c9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine Dijon mustard and 1/2 the garlic aioli. Add slaw mix, celery and charred corn. Toss to coat.\n• In a medium bowl, combine All-American spice blend and a drizzle of olive oil. Add haloumi, turning to coat.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. TIP: Keep an eye on the haloumi as the spice blend will char quickly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625f91336a7d773f7a3577f4/step-04904241.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• Divide American BBQ haloumi, corn slaw and sweet potato wedges between plates.\n• Garnish with chilli. Serve with remaining garlic aioli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625f91336a7d773f7a3577f4/step-597fcc87.jpg"
    }
  ]
